  " (no HDR)": {"translation":"（无 HDR）","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5672ed04bfd0e8db9418af560aed087fc01085631be270f5daf66f174dac215b"},
  "[{0}/{1}] {2}": {"translation":"[{0}/{1}] {2}","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"5fb6f2415218c6686d5b370846d4996bdae1d54106a21499e6c469beddc487b6"},
  "Heads up — you're installing both RenoDX and Luma on this game.\n\nThere's no guarantee they'll work well together. If you're using RenoDX for HDR and just want Luma for DLAA, make sure to disable HDR in the Luma mod settings to avoid conflicts.\n\nIf something doesn't look right, uninstalling one of them is the first thing to try. We can't offer support for issues that come from running both together.": {"translation":"注意——你正在为此游戏同时安装 RenoDX 和 Luma。\n\n无法保证两者能够良好共存。如果你使用 RenoDX 实现 HDR，而只想使用 Luma 的 DLAA，请务必在 Luma 模组设置中关闭 HDR，以避免冲突。\n\n如果显示效果异常，首先尝试卸载其中一个。对于同时运行两者所导致的问题，我们无法提供支持。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e645c30bcb80cb0e55c320b860b02205326a1b30ee5a59dec053e43b6e7c4321"},
  "Hide": {"translation":"隐藏","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ac20a57bfde0bbc40bfe70895eb1cfacc944aaff06ca784053623c569b3e1b3d"},
  "Include this game in Update All for:": {"translation":"将此游戏包含在“全部更新”的以下项目中：","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"925fb328215ccc20424a7013e7c56c5f3274a217d69a2bc2143297cef4cb56e5"},
  "Installing the Vulkan ReShade layer requires writing to C:\\ProgramData\\ReShade\\ and modifying system registry keys, which needs administrator privileges.\n\nEnable Admin Mode — RHI will always launch elevated (no UAC prompt after setup).\n\nRestart as Admin — one-time elevated restart to complete this install.": {"translation":"安装 Vulkan ReShade 层需要写入 C:\\ProgramData\\ReShade\\ 并修改系统注册表项，因此需要管理员权限。\n\n启用管理员模式——RHI 将始终以管理员权限启动（完成设置后不再出现 UAC 提示）。\n\n以管理员身份重启——仅本次以管理员权限重启，以完成安装。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"27e7dd866b92e86d811ae3e2cce4f04e747c4e56dd2e69ff4567695d36dc5130"},
  "Luma OFF": {"translation":"Luma：关","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ee6b6708c11b11bebb27b87f85d32df016f00b3e17b7d3cd0a2bf8c5e81af7a1"},
  "Luma ON": {"translation":"Luma：开","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"55f926ec94d0a436d9491219795bf684dd3927660380a70a5669c6f013ae99af"},
  "MFG Ada Unlock unlocks DLSS Multi Frame Generation (3x/4x and above) on RTX 40-series GPUs.\n\nConfigure via the ReShade overlay in-game.": {"translation":"MFG Ada Unlock 可在 RTX 40 系列 GPU 上解锁 DLSS 多帧生成（3x/4x 及以上）。\n\n请在游戏内通过 ReShade 覆盖层进行配置。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"c6ac4bcd49bede6d4b1b16210529d80e752fb6b03f6c3561b3282bfbd7d80432"},
  "Multi Frame Generation (MFG) and Dynamic MFG are only supported on NVIDIA 50 Series GPUs (Blackwell architecture).\n\nMinimum driver requirements:\n• MFG (Fixed): Driver 572.16+\n• DMFG (Dynamic): Driver 595.97+\n\nThese settings will have no effect on 40 Series or older hardware.": {"translation":"多帧生成（MFG）和动态 MFG 仅支持 NVIDIA RTX 50 系列 GPU（Blackwell 架构）。\n\n最低驱动要求：\n• MFG（固定）：驱动 572.16+\n• DMFG（动态）：驱动 595.97+\n\n这些设置对 RTX 40 系列及更旧硬件无效。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"d0162b354346119fd40a6de178a8b6111092f0868ec4cfccfc4159270dee6d5e"},
  "Not all Unreal Engine games are compatible with UE-Extended.\n\nUE-Extended uses a generic injection method that works with most Unreal Engine games but may cause crashes or visual issues with others. If the game has a named RenoDX mod, that mod is specifically tailored for the game and may provide better results.": {"translation":"并非所有虚幻引擎游戏都兼容 UE-Extended。\n\nUE-Extended 使用通用注入方式，适用于大多数虚幻引擎游戏，但在部分游戏中可能导致崩溃或画面问题。如果该游戏有专用的 RenoDX 模组，专用模组针对该游戏进行了适配，效果可能更好。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"73eedc2d969badb493c076f83533a7fe8e97a825570a017d66ea19fd87dac18a"},
  "Press Backspace in-game to open the RTX 40 MFG menu.\n\n• Follow game — uses the game's own MFG setting\n• Fixed 2x–6x — forces a specific multiplier\n• Dynamic — targets the display refresh rate or a custom FPS value\n\nIf frames freeze above 2x, try setting Frame Generation to Preset B in the NVIDIA App.": {"translation":"在游戏中按 Backspace 打开 RTX 40 MFG 菜单。\n\n• 跟随游戏——使用游戏自身的 MFG 设置\n• 固定 2x–6x——强制使用指定倍数\n• 动态——以显示器刷新率或自定义 FPS 为目标\n\n如果高于 2x 时画面冻结，请尝试在 NVIDIA App 中将帧生成功能设置为预设 B。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"2d5026f618960f07bd2e2245218c985bebd579cfa3159dd4fc806bca256ed18e"},
  "ReShade addons are advanced features intended for experienced users who understand what they are.\n\nAddons can modify game rendering behaviour and may cause instability. Only proceed if you are comfortable managing ReShade addons.": {"translation":"ReShade 附加组件属于高级功能，适合了解其用途的有经验用户。\n\n附加组件可以修改游戏渲染行为，也可能导致不稳定。只有在你能够自行管理 ReShade 附加组件时再继续。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ec5e8cf17e1f18a1699c780f2b779fed0ee480140ab70262436f7f2620c9b599"},
  "ReShade32.dll": {"translation":"ReShade32.dll","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"ea51b6a6b68bb2e24733fef58200faaa9092594343d03fb4ef86cc71d6e636bb"},
  "ReShade64.dll": {"translation":"ReShade64.dll","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"7aea29c75c1d36a18f7cb5e6119f10edaab3b72e6e6db7f624593192c898f358"},
  "RHI is the active nxm:// handler": {"translation":"RHI 是当前的 nxm:// 处理程序","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"6a5519950387810fe863cdb840349b95738d2383c0bb97bdccfd39ff50708032"},
  "RTX HDR uses NVIDIA's driver-level HDR injection to upgrade SDR games to HDR. It works at the GPU level without injecting DLLs into the game, making it compatible with anti-cheat systems.\n\nRequires: NVIDIA App installed, Game Filter/Freestyle enabled, RTX GPU, driver 550+.": {"translation":"RTX HDR 使用 NVIDIA 驱动级 HDR 注入，将 SDR 游戏升级为 HDR。它在 GPU 层工作，无需向游戏注入 DLL，因此可与反作弊系统兼容。\n\n要求：已安装 NVIDIA App、已启用游戏滤镜/Freestyle、RTX GPU、550+ 驱动。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a60f55e59b53d3fb4e2cef6010bb3454a96b0c54c25897089a9eba8a23b68b19"},
  "s": {"translation":"s","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"043a718774c572bd8a25adbeb1bfcd5c0256ae11cecf9f9c3f925d0e52beaf89"},
  "Select your GPU generation. This controls which rendering path is used.\n\nRTX 30 Series (SM86) — Ampere\nRTX 20 Series (SM75) — Turing\n\nReinstall after changing to apply the new setting.": {"translation":"选择你的 GPU 世代。此设置决定使用哪种渲染路径。\n\nRTX 30 系列（SM86）— Ampere\nRTX 20 系列（SM75）— Turing\n\n更改后请重新安装以应用新设置。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"cc8b6ceca1f9760157919896191aef1da01e42520ad3aeee99b161e2a648599a"},
  "Show": {"translation":"显示","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"0df6f1cad36c49da768a6efdcc2c4be102f5729f7381cb53e4ff8061d17eaeb6"},
  "This will clear all caches and re-scan everything from scratch:\n\n• Re-detects all games from every storefront\n• Re-scans DLSS/Streamline DLL paths\n• Re-detects graphics APIs and engine types\n• Rebuilds shader and addon deployment state\n\nTry a normal Refresh first — it handles most issues without the full rescan. Use Full Refresh as a last resort if games are missing, paths have changed, DLSS has been added to a game, or the DLSS section is missing from a game card.\n\nThe next couple of restarts may take a few seconds longer while caches are rebuilt.\n\nDo not close RHI while the refresh is in progress — closing early will result in a missing library and the scan will need to be repeated.": {"translation":"这将清除所有缓存，并从头重新扫描全部内容：\n\n• 重新检测所有商店中的全部游戏\n• 重新扫描 DLSS/Streamline DLL 路径\n• 重新检测图形 API 和引擎类型\n• 重建着色器和附加组件的部署状态\n\n请先尝试普通“刷新”——大多数问题无需完整重扫即可解决。仅当游戏缺失、路径已变化、游戏新增了 DLSS，或游戏卡片中缺少 DLSS 区域时，才将“完整刷新”作为最后手段。\n\n接下来的几次重启可能会多花几秒时间，因为缓存正在重建。\n\n刷新过程中不要关闭 RHI——提前关闭会导致游戏库缺失，需要重新扫描。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"b02b840225cd674d7fc1cf6b19e77e57cfd75fdb83d1a6f8758beeb03ab45c52"},
  "Unregister": {"translation":"取消注册","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"be01aa28a44c6b3f0f4ca2a69efdb7e32f510d4f42b13d68034dda36677a2e13"},
  "Vulkan games share a global ReShade layer.\n\nChanging the channel for this game will change it for ALL Vulkan games.": {"translation":"Vulkan 游戏共用一个全局 ReShade 层。\n\n更改此游戏的频道会同时更改所有 Vulkan 游戏的频道。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"e44935c3af4fc1b63ce3f913b9324231319e907a6130c21ca7b896bfdb40b80d"},
  "When On, installing ShortFuse will automatically:\n• Rename ReShade to Reshade64.asi\n• Install ASI Loader (winmm → version → dinput8)\n• Write HookStreamline=1 and HookDirectX=1 to reshade.ini\n\nThese steps are needed for FrameGen to work correctly after ReShade.\n\nNote: no longer required on ShortFuse v0.54 and above.": {"translation":"开启后，安装 ShortFuse 时将自动：\n• 将 ReShade 重命名为 Reshade64.asi\n• 安装 ASI Loader（winmm → version → dinput8）\n• 向 reshade.ini 写入 HookStreamline=1 和 HookDirectX=1\n\n这些步骤用于确保 FrameGen 在 ReShade 之后正常工作。\n\n注意：ShortFuse v0.54 及以上版本已不再需要这些步骤。","state":"reviewed","source_hash":"a227c6dba8b0211b0040e2f91de766fe33b46ff48639c361dcd0b2bf372bfeff"},
